# README screenshots. The add-on directory *is* what Kodi installs, so anything
# tracked here lands on every user's device -- including those who install by
# cloning, which .gitattributes' export-ignore cannot help with. The images
# therefore live only on the orphan `gh-pages` branch, which the README links
# to by absolute URL; this directory is just the local source they are
# published from. To (re)publish after changing a screenshot:
#
#   git worktree add --orphan -b gh-pages ../bgm-pages   # first time only
#   cp -r docs/img ../bgm-pages/
#   git -C ../bgm-pages add img && git -C ../bgm-pages commit -m "Update screenshots"
#   git -C ../bgm-pages push -u origin gh-pages
docs/
